  TextComponent:
    TextString: Enter commits a single line. Multiline Enter adds a line; command+Enter submits. Tab moves focus. Cancel restores your edit unless a newer programmatic value replaced it. Ctrl/Cmd+A/C/X/V/Z work on the active field. Composition preedit is unsupported by this GLFW backend; committed text is separate from physical keys.
